  "comment": [
    "CJK hardcoded-string ratchet baseline. Scope: ALL of",
    "src/android/app/src/main/java (expanded from com/openminis/app/ui/ —",
    "non-UI layers could previously hoard Chinese copy outside the gate, e.g.",
    "tools/ prompts whose KDoc said the file sits outside the CJK gate).",
    "Non-UI entries registered at expansion time are intentional prompt/copy",
    "text (intentional prompts in tools layer): tools/ (SupervisorPrompts,",
    "CollabRoles, GroupChat, DiscussionGraph, SubAgent*, PlanDiscussion*,",
    "MindMapTeamImport, ...), agent/ and evolution/ prompt assembly,",
    "speech/correction vocabulary tables, provider/ModelAliasMatcher keyword",
    "tables, security/ capability wording, sandbox guest scripts.",
    "Known debt to revisit in later batches (not tool prompts): user-visible",
    "strings living in non-UI layers (data/repository/MemoryRepository.kt",
    "tool error text, sandbox/offload handler messages, security/Capability.kt",
    "display names, i18n/TranslationPrefs.kt) — candidates for strings.xml or",
    "a copy module. The counts are ceilings: they only tighten via",
    "python3 scripts/ci/check_cjk_literals.py --update-baseline."
  ],
